 "summary": "build_search_index.py fails \"unexpected token in shard-*.json\" when cache has stale tokenizer version; fix with --clear-cache",
 "content": "Running `python scripts/build_search_index.py` exits 1 with \"index build failed: unexpected token in shard-000.json\" when var/cache/search/ holds shards written with an older TOKENIZER version (the script compares each shard's \"tokenizer\" field to the TOKENIZER constant). The message says \"token\", not \"stale cache\". Fix: rerun with `--clear-cache`, which only deletes the cached shards (derived data) before rebuilding. Likely to recur after any TOKENIZER bump.",
 "tags": [
